{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hLHFVmzHCx1795086046.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國桌球大師賽，「白旋風」韋德外圍賽兩連勝。</p><p></p><p>64歲的韋德上圈擊敗年輕43年的保爾高，今場面對細21歲的英格蘭球手沙治，同樣要打足九局。決勝局領先43-21時，白球「撻死」，讓對手有反勝機會，只是沙治把握不到。兩度一桿破百的他，「薄切」黑球失手，韋德「磨桿」擦掌，「埋枱」拿多24分。</p><p></p><p>上一次贏排名賽冠軍是2004年，近年最好成績，是前年打入北愛公開賽32強。打入藍球贏67-37，局數5-4再過一關，下場與中國的龐俊旭爭入正賽。港將傅家俊亦晉級。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.469029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:13.948674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:03.924357+00:00","content_hash":"5ddb89e5ff2c28f1cbb1b523bd738445a610bd4958edf64d16666422b176b946","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.469029+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}